## Scenarios

### WS-D6 occlusion coverage predicate
_wm_rect_covered must never claim coverage it cannot prove._

#### degenerate inputs

#### an empty or inverted rect is trivially covered

- Verify: an empty or inverted rect is trivially covered


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: an empty or inverted rect is trivially covered")
assert_true(_covered(10, 10, 0, 40, []))
assert_true(_covered(10, 10, 40, 0, []))
assert_true(_covered(10, 10, -5, 40, []))
```

</details>

